# Client data never belongs in this repository.
#
# The site is served by GitHub Pages from the repository root, and the repo
# is public — anything committed here is published twice over: once on the
# website and once through GitHub itself. Registers built from the Salesforce
# export (data/build-vehicle-register.py) are for importing into the PRIVATE
# Claims TT Google Sheet only.
data/*.csv
data/*.json

node_modules/
__pycache__/

# Recruit tracker: the seed candidate and the dataset CSVs are imported into the
# private workbook, never committed. The page holds no data.
recruiting/*.json
recruiting/*.csv
recruiting/seed/
